---
layout: base
title: Blog
permalink: /blog/
description: Plain-English tech advice for Tampa Bay business owners, on websites, accessibility, booking and follow-up, and hiring the right help.
---

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-gray-900 md:text-5xl">Blog</h1>
    <p class="lede mt-4">Plain-English tech advice for local business owners. Things you can check yourself, and questions worth asking before you spend money.</p>

    {% if collections.post and collections.post.length %}
      <div class="mt-12 space-y-6">
        {% for post in collections.post %}
          <article class="card">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
              <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-gulf-700">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
            </h2>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
              <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-gray-700">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
          </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <div class="card-muted mt-12">
        <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Posts are on the way.</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-gray-700">We are writing practical guides for local business owners. In the meantime, the <a href="{{ site.cta.href }}" class="link">{{ site.cta.label }}</a> is the quickest way to find out where your website and booking flow stand.</p>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band-dark on-dark section">
  <div class="wrap-narrow text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-white md:text-4xl">Want a second pair of eyes on your own site?</h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-lg text-sand-100">The Free Tech Checkup is a 20-minute call plus a written scan of your website, booking flow and Google presence. You get a plain-English list of what to fix first.</p>
    <p class="mt-8">
      <a href="{{ site.cta.href }}" class="btn-light">Book my {{ site.cta.label }}</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
